# Whitelist: the repo root is the build context of the app image only, and
# it needs just the code, the templates, the pinned dependencies and the
# licence (the published image is a distribution under AGPL-3.0). Anything
# not listed stays out (docs/credentials, config.env, certs, logs, .venv, .git).
# The nginx and postgres images build from their own folders under deploy/.
*
!src/
!templates/
!requirements.lock
!LICENSE
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
templates/CLAUDE.md
